* uuu   yyyy-mm-dd iTrac        Comment
* SU1   2021-02-16 NOMALL-2443 created
* GGS01 2021-06-23 NOMALL-2474 improve * and ? selection
* GGS02 2021-08-16 NOMALL-2474 fix length for NAT41002
* SU2   2021-08-20 NOMALL-2467 exp. only 1 related obj (FO) (no *)
* SU3   2021-08-26 NOMALL-2484 MSG for node field without 'R-'
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
